    {
      "id": "blk_04c9847f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "氤柔水境是唯一一片存在于现实世界的索诺拉。此地常年不散的「云海」实际上由高浓度的回音能量构成。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_39f93ce2",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "氤氲的水雾中有时会传来一阵摄人心魄的歌声……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_366ea332",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "氤柔水境中的「云海」据说是第一次黑潮留下的残迹。云海逐渐上涨，淹没了被称为「旧神学院」的隐海修会中枢机构，修会因此迁移至拉古那城的水星天教堂。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_868c3647",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在拉古那的传说中，氤柔水境的中心有一片宁静如镜面的水域，它可以净化人们内心的恶念，将它们化为云海的一部分。一些相信此传说的信徒踏上了朝圣之旅，希望能以此得到心灵的平静。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    }
  ]
